---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Why Urbis Concepts?">
    <div class="relative py-24 md:py-32 bg-secondary flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-secondary z-0"></div>
        <div class="relative z-10 text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 text-white">
            <span class="text-primary font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-sm mb-4 block animate-slide-up">Our Philosophy</span>
            <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-heading font-bold mb-8 animate-slide-up delay-100">Built for Generations</h1>
            <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-gray-300 font-light leading-relaxed animate-slide-up delay-200">
                We believe in the power of natural materials, sustainable sourcing, and master craftsmanship.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container mx-auto px-6 py-20">
        <div class="bg-white p-10 md:p-16 rounded-2xl shadow-lg border border-gray-100 max-w-4xl mx-auto -mt-32 relative z-20">
            <div class="prose prose-lg prose-headings:font-heading prose-headings:text-secondary max-w-none text-gray-600">
                <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">The Urbis Difference</h2>
                <p>
                    At Urbis Concepts, we don't just sell furniture; we curate experiences. Each slab of wood is hand-selected 
                    for its unique character, grain patterns, and structural integrity. Our artisans then spend countless hours 
                    finishing each piece to perfection, ensuring it is not only beautiful but durable enough to withstand daily life.
                </p>
                <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 my-12 not-prose">
                    <div class="p-6 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl">
                        <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-xl text-secondary mb-3">Sustainably Sourced</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm">We partner with ethical suppliers to ensure every tree is harvested responsibly.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-6 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl">
                        <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-xl text-secondary mb-3">Kiln Dried Perfection</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm">Our wood is kiln-dried to the optimal moisture content to prevent warping and cracking.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                 <p>
                    Whether you are looking for a statement dining table, a custom desk, or a coffee table that starts a conversation, 
                    Urbis Concepts delivers quality you can see and feel.
                </p>
                <div class="text-center mt-12">
                     <a href="https://urbisconcepts.com" class="inline-block bg-primary text-white px-8 py-3 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest hover:bg-primary/90 transition-colors rounded">
                        Visit Our Main Site
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</BaseLayout>
